graph TD
    A[Start: User requests access] --> B[System: Prompt for credentials]
    B --> C[User: Enter username and password]
    C --> D[System: Verify credentials]
    D -->|Invalid| E[System: Display error message]
    E --> F{Retry attempts < limit?}
    F -->|Yes| B
    F -->|No| G[System: Lock account and notify user]
    D -->|Valid| H{Is MFA enabled?}
    H -->|Yes| I[System: Prompt for MFA input]
    I --> J[User: Provide MFA input]
    J --> K[System: Verify MFA input]
    K -->|Invalid| L[System: Display MFA error]
    L --> M{Retry attempts < limit?}
    M -->|Yes| I
    M -->|No| N[System: Deny access]
    K -->|Valid| O[System: Grant access and issue session token]
    H -->|No| O
    O --> P[End: User accesses the system]

    Q[User: Requests password reset] --> R[System: Prompt for username or email]
    R --> S[User: Provide username or email]
    S --> T[System: Verify if account exists]
    T -->|Account not found| U[System: Display generic message]
    T -->|Account found| V[System: Send reset link or code via email]
    V --> W[User: Receives email and follows reset instructions]
    W --> X[System: Verify reset token]
    X -->|Invalid| Y[System: Display error]
    X -->|Valid| Z[System: Allow user to set new password]
    Z --> AA[User: Set new password]
    AA --> AB[System: Update password and notify user]
